## Known Limitations & Live Testing Notes

See the [`identitynow_segment_v1` resource documentation](../resources/segment_v1.md#known-limitations--live-testing-notes)
for the full list of limitations shared by both the resource and this data
source (both are backed by the same underlying `visibility_criteria`
model/conversion code).

Exactly one of `id` or `name` must be set. Name lookups match the exact
segment name (no partial/prefix matching) and page through
`GET /segments/v1` client-side, since that endpoint has no server-side name
filter; an error is returned if zero or more than one segment share that
name.
